Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|osgi.app.includes|twitter|
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|plugins.deployment.type|osgi|
		|testray.main.component.name|Social Networking|
		|test.assert.warning.exceptions|true|

Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given User first Login PG
	When Page add
		|pageName|Test Page|

Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given Page tear Down PG
Scenario: Twitter Portlet Smoke
Priority: 4
	Given these variables
		|appName|Twitter|
	When Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Test Page|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Twitter|
	Then AntCommand ant Command the value 'remove-plugin -Dplugin.name=twitter-portlet' at locator 'build-test.xml'
Scenario: View Entry
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|test.name.skip.portal.instance|OSGiTwitterportlet#ViewEntry|
	When UserBar goto Profile
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Twitter|
	And Twitter configure User Profile
		|twitterProfileName|liferayqa3|
	And Pause at locator '1000'
	And Refresh
	And Twitter view Configured Screen Name
		|twitterProfileName|liferayqa3|
	And Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Activities|
	And ProductMenu goto Control Panel Configuration
		|portlet|System Settings|
	And SystemSettings goto Category
		|category|Other|
	And SystemSettings edit Configuration
		|configurationName|Twitter Service|
	And Type the value '1' at locator 'TextInput#TWITTER'
	And SystemSettings save Configuration
	And UserBar goto Profile
	And Pause at locator '3000'
	And Refresh
	Then Twitter view Feed Entry
		|entryContent|This is a tweet sent on Twitter.|